@startuml
title 物体寸法から実寸テクスチャの反復回数を求める
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Yu Gothic UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 24
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor #f7fbff
}
rectangle "直方体の辺長[m]\n2 × 3 × 4" as Size #eaf7e8
rectangle "mapRealCuboid()\n各面のmeter UV" as UV
rectangle "presetの一周期[m]\ntileSizeMeters" as Tile #f4edff
rectangle "表示寸法倍率\nscale" as Scale #f4edff
rectangle "描画用UV\nmeter UV ÷ (周期 × scale)" as Result #fdeaea
rectangle "Shape.endShape()\n換算済みUVをGPUへ転送" as End #eaf7e8
Size --> UV
UV --> Result
Tile --> Result
Scale --> Result
Result --> End
note bottom of Scale
大きいほど模様が大きくなり
反復回数は少なくなる
end note
@enduml
